# LaTeX build artifacts. Patterns apply in every edition directory.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz

# main.pdf and ebook/book-ebook.epub ARE tracked, deliberately: the finished
# book should travel with its sources so a reader of the repo does not have to
# own a TeX installation to see it. The cost is that both are binaries that
# change on every build, so a rebuild always dirties the tree -- commit them
# when the change is real, and `git checkout -- '*.pdf' '*.epub'` when it is
# only a timestamp. Figure PDFs under figs/ are tracked for the same reason.

# Finder droppings
.DS_Store
